&lt;h1 id=&#34;四-双向循环链表&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;markdownIt-Anchor&#34; href=&#34;#四-双向循环链表&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt; 四、双向循环链表&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;img data-src=&#34;\images\article_images\image-20250922213435977.png&#34; alt=&#34;image-20250922213435977&#34; style=&#34;zoom: 50%;&#34; /&gt;
